abstract: >-
  Real-time LLM hallucination guardrail. Dual-entropy scoring (NLI contradiction
  via FactCG-DeBERTa-v3-Large + RAG fact-checking) with claim-level streaming halt.
  75.6% per-dataset mean balanced accuracy on LLM-AggreFact (29K samples, #6 on
  published leaderboard; 77.76% with per-dataset threshold tuning). Meta-confidence scoring,
  cross-turn contradiction tracking, structured output verification (JSON, tool calls,
  code), and online calibration from production feedback.
  Integrates with LangChain, LlamaIndex, LangGraph, Haystack, and CrewAI.
keywords:
